Package: ABTMicrobiome
Type: Package
Title: Aggregated Boosted Trees for Microbiome-Environment Association
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiaoyu", "Wang", email = "xiaoyuwang515@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A toolkit that aggregates boosted regression trees (ABT) to
    model the relationship between environmental variables and microbial
    community dissimilarities. Provides distance matrix computation for
    OTU/ASV tables (Bray-Curtis, Jaccard) and phylogenetic trees
    (weighted/unweighted UniFrac), pairwise environmental differences,
    cross-validated gradient boosting with tree-count selection, and
    diagnostic visualisations (variable importance, CV error, partial
    dependence, interaction strength).
